{"seq":3,"slug":"ubo-sanctions-aml-interface","title":"UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口（联163）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/ubo-controller-due-diligence/ubo-sanctions-aml-interface","wordCount":2453,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"ubo-与制裁-aml-筛查接口-联163\">UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口（联163）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前两篇产出的是一个<strong>带置信度的自然人集合</strong>：穿透出的 UBO、控权人、法定代表人，以及各自的挂名风险。本篇处理这个集合的下一步——把它们送进制裁与反洗钱筛查引擎，并把引擎的结论落回尽调档案。</p>\n<p>这一篇的重点是<strong>接口契约而非匹配算法</strong>。名单装载、名字规范化、模糊匹配打分、阈值调优属于制裁筛查引擎（相邻 hub，本 hub 不展开）的职责；本 hub 只负责定义：送什么、期望什么语义的返回、命中之后在尽调档案里怎么落痕、以及两者之间的事务边界在哪里。</p>\n<p>把边界画清楚有一个直接收益：筛查引擎会演进（换名单源、换匹配算法、调整阈值），如果 KYB 系统把匹配逻辑内联进来，每次引擎升级都要动尽调代码。反过来，如果 KYB 只是把&quot;某人被筛查过&quot;的布尔结论存下来，那么引擎换了结论口径时平台无从追溯。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[UBO 解析结果&lt;br/&gt;自然人 + 置信度] --&gt; B[筛查请求组装]&#10;  B --&gt; C[规范化字段&lt;br/&gt;姓名/别名/出生日期/国籍/证件]&#10;  C --&gt; D[筛查引擎 163]&#10;  D --&gt; E{命中结论}&#10;  E --&gt;|clear| F[记录筛查凭证]&#10;  E --&gt;|potential_match| G[人工复核队列]&#10;  E --&gt;|confirmed_match| H[硬阻断 + 上报]&#10;  G --&gt; I{复核结果}&#10;  I --&gt;|false_positive| J[记录误报,用于调优]&#10;  I --&gt;|true_positive| H&#10;  F --&gt; K[尽调档案落痕]&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  H --&gt; K&#10;  H --&gt; L[联动商家处置]\">graph TD\n  A[UBO 解析结果&lt;br/&gt;自然人 + 置信度] --&gt; B[筛查请求组装]\n  B --&gt; C[规范化字段&lt;br/&gt;姓名/别名/出生日期/国籍/证件]\n  C --&gt; D[筛查引擎 163]\n  D --&gt; E{命中结论}\n  E --&gt;|clear| F[记录筛查凭证]\n  E --&gt;|potential_match| G[人工复核队列]\n  E --&gt;|confirmed_match| H[硬阻断 + 上报]\n  G --&gt; I{复核结果}\n  I --&gt;|false_positive| J[记录误报,用于调优]\n  I --&gt;|true_positive| H\n  F --&gt; K[尽调档案落痕]\n  J --&gt; K\n  H --&gt; K\n  H --&gt; L[联动商家处置]</pre><h2 id=\"请求契约\">请求契约</h2><h3 id=\"送什么字段\">送什么字段</h3><p>筛查的输入质量直接决定召回率。只送一个姓名的筛查几乎等于没做——重名会把匹配池撑爆，而缺少识别性字段（出生日期、国籍、证件号）又会让真正的命中被淹没在误报里。一个完整的筛查主体应当包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;screening_request_id&quot;: &quot;sr_20260928_00041&quot;,&#10;  &quot;case_ref&quot;: &quot;kyb:lei:5493000IBP32UQZ0KL24&quot;,&#10;  &quot;subjects&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;subject_ref&quot;: &quot;person:P1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: [&quot;ubo&quot;, &quot;legal_representative&quot;],&#10;      &quot;names&quot;: [&#10;        { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;primary&quot;, &quot;script&quot;: &quot;latn&quot;, &quot;full&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;given&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;family&quot;: &quot;…&quot; },&#10;        { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;alias&quot;, &quot;script&quot;: &quot;cyrl&quot;, &quot;full&quot;: &quot;…&quot; }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;dob&quot;: { &quot;date&quot;: &quot;1974-03-02&quot;, &quot;precision&quot;: &quot;day&quot; },&#10;      &quot;nationalities&quot;: [&quot;CN&quot;],&#10;      &quot;identifiers&quot;: [{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;passport&quot;, &quot;issuing_country&quot;: &quot;CN&quot;, &quot;value_hmac&quot;: &quot;…&quot; }],&#10;      &quot;addresses&quot;: [{ &quot;iso_country&quot;: &quot;SG&quot;, &quot;normalized_text&quot;: &quot;…&quot; }],&#10;      &quot;context&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;uboCandidate&quot;: true,&#10;        &quot;effective_ratio&quot;: 0.54,&#10;        &quot;nominee_risk_band&quot;: &quot;low&quot;,&#10;        &quot;id_assurance&quot;: &quot;high&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;lists&quot;: [&quot;OFAC-SDN&quot;, &quot;EU-CFSP&quot;, &quot;UN-1267&quot;, &quot;PEP&quot;, &quot;adverse-media&quot;],&#10;  &quot;requested_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"screening_request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sr_20260928_00041\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"case_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kyb:lei:5493000IBP32UQZ0KL24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"subjects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"subject_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person:P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ubo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"legal_representative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"names\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"script\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"full\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"given\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"family\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alias\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"script\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cyrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"full\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1974-03-02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"precision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"day\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"nationalities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"identifiers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"passport\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"issuing_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value_hmac\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"addresses\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"iso_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SG\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"normalized_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"context\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"uboCandidate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"effective_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.54</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"nominee_risk_band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"id_assurance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lists\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OFAC-SDN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU-CFSP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UN-1267\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PEP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"adverse-media\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requested_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>设计要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>subject_ref</code> 必须与尽调档案里的人主键一致</strong>，否则命中结论无法回写。这是整个接口最重要的约束。</li>\n<li><strong><code>names</code> 是数组且带 <code>script</code> 与 <code>type</code></strong>。同一自然人在不同证件上的姓名拼写可能不同（拉丁转写、西里尔转写、本名与别名），送多拼写是提升召回率最廉价的手段。把所有拼写塞进一个字段用空格分隔是常见的实现错误，它让引擎无法判断哪个是全名。</li>\n<li><strong>证件号送 HMAC 而不是明文</strong>。筛查引擎需要它做精确匹配，但明文证件号在跨系统的传输与日志里是高风险数据；用同一密钥的 HMAC 既能精确匹配又不泄露原值（密钥由引擎与 KYB 共享，独立于业务密钥轮换）。</li>\n<li><strong><code>context</code> 是 KYB 侧的知识</strong>，引擎本身看不到：这个人是 UBO 还是普通员工、穿透置信度多少、身份核验强度如何。带上它可以让引擎按风险调整匹配严格度，也可以在命中时给人工复核提供上下文。</li>\n<li><strong><code>lists</code> 显式声明</strong>，而不是让引擎默认用全部名单。不同名单的合规目的不同（制裁名单是硬阻断，PEP 与负面信息是风险信号），混在一个&quot;命中&quot;里会让下游无法区分处置力度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"幂等与批处理\">幂等与批处理</h3><p>筛查请求必须带业务幂等键（<code>case_ref</code> + 主体集合指纹），重复提交同一组主体不应产生重复的筛查工单。批量场景（一次入驻涉及十几个主体）应当走一次批量请求而不是 N 次单主体请求，这既降低引擎压力，也让&quot;这一批结论属于同一次尽调时点&quot;这个语义显式化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应契约与结论语义\">响应契约与结论语义</h2><h3 id=\"三档结论而非布尔\">三档结论而非布尔</h3><p>响应必须区分至少三档：<code>clear</code>（无命中）、<code>potential_match</code>（疑似，需人工复核）、<code>confirmed_match</code>（确认命中）。把中间档压掉是最常见的接口设计错误——引擎的模糊匹配天然会产生大量疑似命中，如果只返回 0/1，这些疑似要么全被当命中（误拒率失控），要么全被丢弃（漏拦风险）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;screening_request_id&quot;: &quot;sr_20260928_00041&quot;,&#10;  &quot;engine_version&quot;: &quot;…&quot;,&#10;  &quot;list_versions&quot;: { &quot;OFAC-SDN&quot;: &quot;2026-09-25&quot;, &quot;EU-CFSP&quot;: &quot;2026-09-24&quot; },&#10;  &quot;results&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;subject_ref&quot;: &quot;person:P1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;potential_match&quot;,&#10;      &quot;hits&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;list&quot;: &quot;OFAC-SDN&quot;,&#10;          &quot;entry_uid&quot;: &quot;…&quot;,&#10;          &quot;score&quot;: 0.83,&#10;          &quot;matched_fields&quot;: [&quot;name.alias&quot;, &quot;dob.year&quot;],&#10;          &quot;list_program&quot;: &quot;…&quot;,&#10;          &quot;sanctions_ownership_ratio&quot;: null&#10;        }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;screened_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T00:00:03Z&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"screening_request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sr_20260928_00041\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"engine_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"list_versions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"OFAC-SDN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"EU-CFSP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"subject_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person:P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"potential_match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"list\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OFAC-SDN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"entry_uid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.83</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"matched_fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name.alias\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dob.year\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"list_program\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"sanctions_ownership_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"screened_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T00:00:03Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong><code>list_versions</code> 必须返回</strong>，因为名单是每日甚至更频繁更新的。没有版本号，平台无法回答&quot;这个人在 2026 年 3 月那次筛查时，用的是哪一版名单&quot;——而这个问题在事后审计中一定会被问到。这也直接决定了重筛（rescreen）的触发逻辑（见下）。</p>\n<p><strong><code>matched_fields</code> 必须返回</strong>，它是人工复核效率的关键：一个只命中姓氏的疑似和一个命中姓名加出生年月的疑似，复核优先级完全不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"50-规则的位置\">50% 规则的位置</h3><p>OFAC 的 <strong>50% 规则</strong>规定，被一个或多个被制裁主体<strong>合计拥有 50% 或以上</strong>的实体即被冻结；该规则<strong>只谈所有权、不谈控制</strong>，且通过中间实体的间接持股在中间实体自身也被 50% 以上持有时才计入（<a href=\"https://ofac.treasury.gov/faqs/topic/1521\">OFAC 50 Percent Rule</a>）。</p>\n<p>这条规则在架构上属于<strong>引擎侧还是 KYB 侧</strong>，需要明确决定。合理的分工是：<strong>股权图谱在 KYB 侧，阈值判定复用引擎的名单状态</strong>。原因是判定需要两样东西——完整的持股比例（只有 KYB 的图有）与名单命中状态（只有引擎有）。因此接口需要一个反向查询：KYB 把持股 50% 以上的<strong>法人</strong>主体也送入筛查（不只是自然人），并在收到命中后计算聚合持股是否达到 50%。</p>\n<p>注意这里 50% 与 UBO 的 25% 是<strong>两个独立阈值</strong>，服务于不同目的，绝不可复用同一参数——这一点在 <a href=\"ubo-25pct-ownership-layering\">UBO 25% 穿透与控权人识别</a> 已强调，接口层要把它们表达成两个显式字段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"名单更新与重筛\">名单更新与重筛</h3><p>名单每日更新，而平台上的商家是长期存续的。重筛策略有三种常见形态，实践中应当组合使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增量重筛</td>\n<td>名单版本变化</td>\n<td>仅订阅了该名单的主体</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定期重筛</td>\n<td>固定周期（如每 90 天）</td>\n<td>活跃商家全量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件重筛</td>\n<td>登记变更 / 持股变化 / 风险档上调</td>\n<td>受影响主体</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量重筛</td>\n<td>引擎版本升级或阈值调整</td>\n<td>全部历史主体</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>增量重筛是主力</strong>：名单版本变了，只有新增或修改的条目可能产生新命中，因此只需要重筛&quot;与新增条目可能相关&quot;的主体子集。但实现增量重筛需要一个前提——引擎能给出<strong>名单差异</strong>而不仅是名单全量。如果引擎只提供全量名单，增量重筛就退化为全量重筛，成本会迫使团队把周期拉长，这就是漏拦的来源。</p>\n<p>事件重筛与 <a href=\"../kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/ongoing-monitoring-change-rescreen\">工商变更/存续状态持续监控</a> 共用触发基础设施：UBO 集合发生变化时（新增了穿透出的人），这些人<strong>必须</strong>立刻补做筛查，不能等到下一个定期周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落痕与事务边界\">落痕与事务边界</h2><h3 id=\"尽调档案里的筛查凭证\">尽调档案里的筛查凭证</h3><p>每一次筛查（无论结论）都必须在尽调档案里留下不可变凭证。凭证的作用不是记录&quot;通过&quot;，而是记录<strong>当时依据了什么</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE screening_evidence (&#10;  evidence_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_ref        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  subject_ref     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  request_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  engine_version  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  list_versions   JSONB NOT NULL,      -- {&quot;OFAC-SDN&quot;:&quot;2026-09-25&quot;, ...}&#10;  outcome         TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (outcome IN (&#39;clear&#39;,&#39;potential_match&#39;,&#39;confirmed_match&#39;)),&#10;  hits            JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;[]&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  reviewed_by     TEXT,                -- 人工复核人（potential_match 必填）&#10;  review_outcome  TEXT,                -- &#39;false_positive&#39; | &#39;true_positive&#39;&#10;  reviewed_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ON screening_evidence (request_id, subject_ref);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON screening_evidence (case_ref, subject_ref, created_at DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> screening_evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_ref        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  engine_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  list_versions   JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"OFAC-SDN\":\"2026-09-25\", ...}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outcome         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'potential_match'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed_match'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hits            JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reviewed_by     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 人工复核人（potential_match 必填）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  review_outcome  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'false_positive' | 'true_positive'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reviewed_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> screening_evidence (request_id, subject_ref);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> screening_evidence (case_ref, subject_ref, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>凭证<strong>只追加不修改</strong>。人工复核的结论写在新字段上而不是覆盖原结论，这样&quot;引擎判疑似、人工判误报&quot;这个链条完整保留，它是后续做误报率分析与阈值调优的唯一数据来源（见 <a href=\"../kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/kyb-coverage-falsepositive-metric\">KYB 覆盖率/误拒/时效度量</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事务边界\">事务边界</h3><p>筛查是一次<strong>跨系统的外部调用</strong>，不能放在入驻事务里同步等待。正确的模式是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>入驻流程为每个主体创建待筛查记录，状态 <code>pending</code>。</li>\n<li>异步 worker 调用引擎，写回 <code>screening_evidence</code>，更新状态。</li>\n<li>尽调决策在<strong>所有主体都有终态结论</strong>时才允许进入最终审批。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 3 条是关键：允许&quot;部分主体已筛查、部分待筛查&quot;的状态进入审批，会产生一类隐蔽的漏洞——审批时看到的是不完整的筛查结果。因此决策入口必须有一个<strong>门禁条件</strong>：主体集合中存在 <code>pending</code> 或 <code>potential_match</code> 未复核的，一律不得给出 <code>approve</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def can_finalize_decision(case_ref):&#10;    subjects = load_subjects(case_ref)&#10;    states = {s.subject_ref: latest_evidence(s.subject_ref) for s in subjects}&#10;    if any(e is None or e.outcome == &quot;pending&quot; for e in states.values()):&#10;        return False, &quot;screening_incomplete&quot;&#10;    if any(e.outcome == &quot;confirmed_match&quot; for e in states.values()):&#10;        return False, &quot;hard_block&quot;&#10;    if any(e.outcome == &quot;potential_match&quot; and e.review_outcome is None&#10;           for e in states.values()):&#10;        return False, &quot;awaiting_manual_review&quot;&#10;    return True, &quot;ok&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> can_finalize_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(case_ref):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    subjects </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_subjects(case_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    states </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {s.subject_ref: latest_evidence(s.subject_ref) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subjects}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> states.values()):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"screening_incomplete\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"confirmed_match\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> states.values()):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hard_block\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"potential_match\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.review_outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> states.values()):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"awaiting_manual_review\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ok\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>确认命中是<strong>硬阻断</strong>，无论其他维度得分多高——它不由分数权衡，直接终止流程。这与 <a href=\"../business-account-qualification/kyb-risk-tier-approval\">KYB 风险分级与入驻审批</a> 里&quot;否决项与加权项分离&quot;的原则一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与处置的联动\">与处置的联动</h3><p>确认命中不只是拒掉这次入驻，还应当联动存量处置：如果该主体已经在平台上经营，命中结论要触发商家状态变更（冻结提现、暂停结算），这条路径通向 <a href=\"../kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/merchant-status-dormancy-revocation\">商家异常/停业/吊销联动</a> 与平台治理侧的商家处罚体系。筛查结论与商家生命周期状态之间应当是<strong>事件驱动</strong>的，而不是被审批流程独占。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>本篇定义的是<strong>接口契约</strong>，匹配算法属于制裁筛查引擎侧；<code>subject_ref</code> 与尽调档案人主键一致是整个接口成立的基石。</li>\n<li>请求要送<strong>多拼写姓名、出生日期、国籍、HMAC 过的证件号</strong>与 KYB 侧上下文；<code>lists</code> 显式声明，避免不同合规目的的结论被混成一个&quot;命中&quot;。</li>\n<li>响应必须是<strong>三档结论</strong>（clear / potential_match / confirmed_match）并返回 <strong><code>list_versions</code> 与 <code>matched_fields</code></strong>；疑似档的存在是控制误拒率的前提。</li>\n<li><strong>50% 制裁所有权阈值与 25% UBO 阈值是两个独立参数</strong>；50% 规则的判定需要 KYB 侧的持股图谱与引擎侧的名单状态协作完成。</li>\n<li>重筛以<strong>增量</strong>为主（依赖引擎提供名单差异），事件重筛与登记变更共用触发基础设施；筛查凭证<strong>只追加不修改</strong>，保留&quot;引擎疑似、人工误报&quot;的完整链条。</li>\n<li>筛查是异步外部调用，决策入口必须有<strong>门禁条件</strong>：存在未筛查或未复核的主体时不得批准；确认命中是硬阻断并联动存量商家处置。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口（联163）","id":"ubo-与制裁-aml-筛查接口-联163"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"请求契约","id":"请求契约"},{"level":3,"text":"送什么字段","id":"送什么字段"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等与批处理","id":"幂等与批处理"},{"level":2,"text":"响应契约与结论语义","id":"响应契约与结论语义"},{"level":3,"text":"三档结论而非布尔","id":"三档结论而非布尔"},{"level":3,"text":"50% 规则的位置","id":"50-规则的位置"},{"level":3,"text":"名单更新与重筛","id":"名单更新与重筛"},{"level":2,"text":"落痕与事务边界","id":"落痕与事务边界"},{"level":3,"text":"尽调档案里的筛查凭证","id":"尽调档案里的筛查凭证"},{"level":3,"text":"事务边界","id":"事务边界"},{"level":3,"text":"与处置的联动","id":"与处置的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"法人身份核验与代持/挂名识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/ubo-controller-due-diligence/legal-rep-id-nominee-detect"},"next":{"title":"对公银行账户归属验证（penny drop）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/business-account-qualification/corporate-bank-account-ownership"}}